# A picture of the made-up chat opened in the viewer and closed (sfbase viewer.mbt): it grows out of its thumbnail in
# the chat, the canvas and its shadow coming with it, and goes back into the thumbnail where the chat has it.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 1000
wheel -900
wait 1800
until img:compare.png
tap img:compare.png
wait 1000
back
wait 1000
